{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each wave, enemies become stronger, bosses deadlier, and loot more valuable. With randomly generated rewards and constantly evolving character traits, a different challenge awaits you every turn. Kill, win, upgrade, start again. Every failure is the foundation of your next victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you abandon your defenses for greater power, or will you play it safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear enemy waves, upgrade your stats with the money you earn, take risks, or play it safe. Defeat bosses and collect rewards with mysterious chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every start, a new strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strategy is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Fight solo or with friends in co-op.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Wave-based combat with increasingly powerful enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Test your character with the bosses you face.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Choose your strategy: Damage, speed, armor, or combo\u2014the choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Choose your destiny with risk-reward mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Survive the arena, slay enemies, and improve yourself with the money you earn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132800?t=1764344209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132800?t=176434